    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aMagic Cells: \u221e Breed\u300b</strong> is a tower defense game set in a microscopic world. Enemies aim to devour all your cell tiles\u2014and once consumed, they may reproduce, mutate, or even hatch more foes. Your mission? Defend your territory by summoning magic cells, deploying tech cards, and harnessing divine power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/9ca6cba55e8c2e5b1ab5cfdb6f9d520b.poster.avif?t=1747881473\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/9ca6cba55e8c2e5b1ab5cfdb6f9d520b.webm?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/9ca6cba55e8c2e5b1ab5cfdb6f9d520b.mp4?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/0a5af95924b1b7a26764ca662b5b042f.poster.avif?t=1747881473\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/0a5af95924b1b7a26764ca662b5b042f.webm?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/0a5af95924b1b7a26764ca662b5b042f.mp4?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>24+ Magic Cells</strong></u> are key to combating swarms of enemies, but they only descend when summoned. Each cell has unique traits:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tile represents a unit of energy, with 12 colors corresponding to different cells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine more tiles to summon stronger cells (higher level, deadlier skills).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cells fall into 3 types: Immune Cells, Shikigami Cells, and Structure Cells (24+ total).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/ced7a8e5e4b4e413e9c7e8ce639aca3d.poster.avif?t=1747881473\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/ced7a8e5e4b4e413e9c7e8ce639aca3d.webm?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/ced7a8e5e4b4e413e9c7e8ce639aca3d.mp4?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/8acfc8736d6f1c5f18dafbe2b3b4c1a4.poster.avif?t=1747881473\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/8acfc8736d6f1c5f18dafbe2b3b4c1a4.webm?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/8acfc8736d6f1c5f18dafbe2b3b4c1a4.mp4?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/e5307a541fce9aaddd9d4ef5be2cd4a2.poster.avif?t=1747881473\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/e5307a541fce9aaddd9d4ef5be2cd4a2.webm?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/e5307a541fce9aaddd9d4ef5be2cd4a2.mp4?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/18aa01d92875d228c94e82e0aa714198.poster.avif?t=1747881473\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/18aa01d92875d228c94e82e0aa714198.webm?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/18aa01d92875d228c94e82e0aa714198.mp4?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>20+ Nightmarish Pathogen Bosses</strong></u>, each with terrifying abilities, will stop at nothing to consume your domain. Defeat them by exploiting their weaknesses:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses have chilling names: Marburg Virus, HIV, Pneumococcus, Tetanus Bacillus, Vibrio\u2026</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They wield active skills and passive traits (e.g., summoning minions).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss has a flaw\u2014victory depends on your strategy!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/bf6cbc098ef6bdc03aff9be1f583dee3.poster.avif?t=1747881473\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/bf6cbc098ef6bdc03aff9be1f583dee3.webm?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/bf6cbc098ef6bdc03aff9be1f583dee3.mp4?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/ac312f1b90af6b7dc7053599985b7a7e.poster.avif?t=1747881473\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/ac312f1b90af6b7dc7053599985b7a7e.webm?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/ac312f1b90af6b7dc7053599985b7a7e.mp4?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/d128d1e98f787034f4a6bddb0e9bd6cc.poster.avif?t=1747881473\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/d128d1e98f787034f4a6bddb0e9bd6cc.webm?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/d128d1e98f787034f4a6bddb0e9bd6cc.mp4?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/03289339d20e319baae74f0e1468b835.poster.avif?t=1747881473\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/03289339d20e319baae74f0e1468b835.webm?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/03289339d20e319baae74f0e1468b835.mp4?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>100+ Minions obey their bosses</strong></u>. Though weak individually, their numbers and teamwork can overwhelm you!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique traits: some replicate, some resist attacks, some explode\u2026</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware replicators! They can flood the screen\u2014and mutations during replication might make them stronger (or weaker?).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parasitic minions are the worst! They lurk in your cell tiles, then erupt into hordes at your doorstep. Game over?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/ff46f3e2dc1b43ab78afdec748437189.poster.avif?t=1747881473\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/ff46f3e2dc1b43ab78afdec748437189.webm?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/ff46f3e2dc1b43ab78afdec748437189.mp4?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>100+ Tech Cards offer endless combos</strong></u>. Use them individually or stack for ultimate moves!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge cell tiles to generate energy. At full energy, draw a card.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card slots limit your combo potential\u2014more slots, more possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card consumes energy. Manage resources wisely!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/5bf8b4c1abce51d2a7c9ce439028df55.poster.avif?t=1747881473\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/5bf8b4c1abce51d2a7c9ce439028df55.webm?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/5bf8b4c1abce51d2a7c9ce439028df55.mp4?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
