ough weak individually, their numbers and teamwork can overwhelm you!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique traits: some replicate, some resist attacks, some explode\u2026</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware replicators! They can flood the screen\u2014and mutations during replication might make them stronger (or weaker?).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parasitic minions are the worst! They lurk in your cell tiles, then erupt into hordes at your doorstep. Game over?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/ff46f3e2dc1b43ab78afdec748437189.poster.avif?t=1747881473\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/ff46f3e2dc1b43ab78afdec748437189.webm?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/ff46f3e2dc1b43ab78afdec748437189.mp4?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>100+ Tech Cards offer endless combos</strong></u>. Use them individually or stack for ultimate moves!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge cell tiles to generate energy. At full energy, draw a card.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card slots limit your combo potential\u2014more slots, more possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card consumes energy. Manage resources wisely!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/5bf8b4c1abce51d2a7c9ce439028df55.poster.avif?t=1747881473\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/5bf8b4c1abce51d2a7c9ce439028df55.webm?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415910/extras/5bf8b4c1abce51d2a7c9ce439028df55.mp4?t=1747881473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
